OL,3,CMan arrested over death of nine-year-
OL,4,Cold girl found in industrial estate
OL,6,FA 35-year-old man has been arrested in
OL,7,Fconnection with the death of a nine-
OL,8,Fyear-old girl who was found seriously
OL,9,Finjured at an industrial estate in
OL,10,FAngus.
OL,12,FPolice Scotland said the girl was
OL,13,Ffound injured at Elliot Industrial
OL,14,FEstate in Arbroath at around 12.02am
OL,15,Fon Monday.
OL,17,FShe was then taken to Ninewells
OL,18,FHospital in Dundee, where she died.
OL,20,FHer death is being treated as
OL,21,Fsuspicious.
