OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FDetective Superintendent Nicky
OL,12,FMcGovern said: "Around 12.02am on
OL,13,FMonday, August 3 2026, officers were
OL,14,Fcalled to Elliot Industrial Estate in
OL,15,FArbroath after a nine-year-old girl
OL,16,Fwas found with serious injuries.
OL,18,F"She was taken to Ninewells Hospital
OL,19,Fin Dundee where she later died.
